sequences often overlap between sources (Figure 7.2, E-G), we attempt to
match POS sequences within ESCO with the POS sequences in the datasets.
For example NOUN-NOUN, NOUN, VERB-NOUN and ADJ-NOUN sequences are
commonly occurring in all three sources.
